# Allowlist: the image builds from the Cargo workspace only, so nothing else
# (secrets, backups, local build output) reaches the build context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rustfmt.toml
!crates/
!apps/
!xtask/
# Patched copies of crates (see vendor/*/PATCHES.md), used through [patch.crates-io].
!vendor/

# Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Local build output
**/target/
apps/tma-cloud-web/dist/
